<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>BHEL v. Sarr Freight Corporation &amp; Anr., FAO (COMM) 249/2025</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Bench</th><td>Avneesh Jhingan and Shail Jain, JJ., High Court of Delhi</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>5 November 2026 (oral judgment)</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Provisions</th><td>Sections 34 and 37, Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996</td></tr>
